      "latest_changelog": "<p>Fixed an issue where the RPCI dialog gets reset whenever a player joins or leaves the server. This was due to an issue with Vintage Story's built-in dropdown GUI element not supporting list updates without redrawing the entire dialog. The dialog will now prevent redraws while the user is in Edit mode, otherwise it will redraw and then restore the previous view. As a side effect, this means that the player list will not sync until after the user leaves the Edit mode. If a player who is no longer online is selected while in Edit mode, the user will be shown their own info instead and notified as to why.</p>",
